                                                "sense_id": "b6bf9c95-f747-3e63-a13b-20a965d76702",
                                                "text": "You'll be prompted with the New Project dialog (see Figure 1.11) from which you'll have at least two types of projects from which to choose […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
